Package: DARESR
Type: Package
Title: Distributional Adaptive Regression Estimator under Series Expansion
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Shengtao", "Dai", email = "shengtao.dai@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements the series (B-spline) version of the distributionally
    adaptive regression estimator (DARE) of Dai (2025)
    <https://ssrn.com/abstract=5683602>. Conditional quantiles are estimated by
    quantile regression on a B-spline basis using 'quantreg', and the
    conditional mean at a target point is estimated by combining them with
    weights from the inverse of their estimated asymptotic covariance matrix,
    with the number of quantiles chosen by cross-validation. This keeps the
    estimator efficient when errors are heavy-tailed or non-Gaussian.
